venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
# Bulk data (price tiers, grid-search logs) is regenerable -- keep it out.
# The two exceptions below are not: live_log.csv is a decision-time forward
# record that can never be recomputed (see append_log in tech_level_live.py),
# and live_combos.json defines what its rows mean. Both are tiny.
data/*
!data/live_log.csv
!data/live_combos.json
